{"3760840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BloodState", "steam_appid": 3760840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a world overrun by the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives, unlock new routes, search for supplies, and survive long enough to reach the next Advance Point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face overwhelming hordes, deadly special infected, zombie dogs, powerful bosses, and dynamic military events that turn every mission into a fight for survival.<br>Loot weapons, ammunition, medical supplies, night vision equipment, and valuable resources as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLOODSTATE is a cinematic first-person zombie survival horror game focused on intense combat, exploration, dynamic objectives, and relentless psychological pressure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/4e96ae023dd816c7489a5d1544c5c962.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/4e96ae023dd816c7489a5d1544c5c962.webp?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT THE INFECTED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive hordes and deadly special infected, each presenting unique threats and combat challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/3502cd51fa758ad1b9b02f6d5d6cd19a.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/3502cd51fa758ad1b9b02f6d5d6cd19a.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE OBJECTIVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power, activate systems, unlock new paths, and push deeper into the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/1c9bbe36b08296eb42138ad8011bf6d5.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/1c9bbe36b08296eb42138ad8011bf6d5.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE DYNAMIC EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience military flyovers, airstrikes, helicopter support, environmental hazards, and unexpected encounters that keep every mission unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/098689d8ce18ac6c538fe8a8456bbc1a.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/098689d8ce18ac6c538fe8a8456bbc1a.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACH THE ADVANCE POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission has one objective: survive long enough to reach the next Advance Point and continue your journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/89735280593bf34f5dcf888fd3037c7f.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/89735280593bf34f5dcf888fd3037c7f.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a world overrun by the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives, unlock new routes, search for supplies, and survive long enough to reach the next Advance Point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face overwhelming hordes, deadly special infected, zombie dogs, powerful bosses, and dynamic military events that turn every mission into a fight for survival.<br>Loot weapons, ammunition, medical supplies, night vision equipment, and valuable resources as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLOODSTATE is a cinematic first-person zombie survival horror game focused on intense combat, exploration, dynamic objectives, and relentless psychological pressure.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/4e96ae023dd816c7489a5d1544c5c962.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/4e96ae023dd816c7489a5d1544c5c962.webp?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT THE INFECTED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle massive hordes and deadly special infected, each presenting unique threats and combat challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/3502cd51fa758ad1b9b02f6d5d6cd19a.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/3502cd51fa758ad1b9b02f6d5d6cd19a.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE OBJECTIVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power, activate systems, unlock new paths, and push deeper into the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/1c9bbe36b08296eb42138ad8011bf6d5.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/1c9bbe36b08296eb42138ad8011bf6d5.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE DYNAMIC EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience military flyovers, airstrikes, helicopter support, environmental hazards, and unexpected encounters that keep every mission unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/098689d8ce18ac6c538fe8a8456bbc1a.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/098689d8ce18ac6c538fe8a8456bbc1a.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REACH THE ADVANCE POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission has one objective: survive long enough to reach the next Advance Point and continue your journey.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras/89735280593bf34f5dcf888fd3037c7f.avif?t=1787852312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/extras_big/89735280593bf34f5dcf888fd3037c7f.avif?t=1787852312 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An elite military team is sent to recover a specimen that could change everything. As the sole survivor, you must restore power, unlock new routes, reactivate critical systems, and uncover why someone wanted the mission buried.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/5686082ddef9d5f49e042aeb4b4dd1144c511d28/header.jpg?t=1787852312", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/47bad6aecc232e954d857706423d26896ac46048/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787852312", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760840/47bad6aecc232e954d857706423d26896ac46048/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787852312", "w